---
source: crates/nuten_parser/tests/parse.rs
input_file: crates/nuten_parser/test_data/err/expression/stray_close_paren.nu
---
Root@0..5
  Pipeline@0..4
    PipelineElement@0..4
      MathExpression@0..4
        Word@0..1 "1"
        Whitespace@1..2 " "
        Error@2..4 "a)"
  Newline@4..5 "\n"
error 3..4 ")": Lex(UnmatchedCloser)
